<p>The majority of SCPs' mechanisms are foreign in some way. The question is whether or not they're unpredictably dangerous. Quik's Locked Box Test covers it well, I think:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>If you can lock the thing away somewhere, leave it alone, and nothing will happen, the thing is Safe.<br />
If you lock something away somewhere and leave it alone, but there's no telling what will happen, it's Euclid.<br />
